  "dasha": "You judge timing from the Vimshottari periods in the evidence pack. The running period is given; do not recompute it. For each period lord active in the horizon: houses it owns, house it sits in, dignity, its position in the subject varga, its nakshatra star lord and that lord's house (a planet gives the results of the houses its star lord signifies), and its relation to the frame houses and lords. Classify each lord as deliverer, supporter, neutral or obstructor. Emit one window per dated period in the horizon with the class in `label`. Output JSON in the schema, every claim with evidence ids.",
  "formats/direct": "Format `direct`: begin with the direct answer in 2-4 sentences. Then 3-6 bullets, each one chart fact and what it means for the question. End with a one-line outlook. At most 500 words.",
