  "templates/T1": "Template T1 — Quick verdict (a yes/no question about one subject).\nAnswer card, then:\n## When\n1-3 dated windows as bullets.\n## What helps / what blocks\nTwo bullets each.\nThen the collapsed \"How I read this\".\nCap: 360 words plus the collapsed block.",
